<title>DENMARK: Danish Q2 GDP rises 2.3 pct yr/yr, 1.0 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>Danish Q2 GDP rises 2.3 pct yr/yr, 1.0 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish GDP rose 2.25 percent year-on-year in the second quarter of 1996 and 1.0 percent from the first quarter of 1996, the National Statistics Office said on Monday.  </p>
<p>					Q2 1996   Q1 1996     Q2 1995</p>
<p>    GDP pct change from	   1.0	+0.6	   -0.4</p>
<p>    previous qtr (seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>--Per Bech Thomsen, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-966950</p>
</text>
